WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:05.104
(MUFFLED APPLAUSE, CHEERS)

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:08.208
HARRY HAFT:<i> It keeps
 going on in my head...</i>

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:11.244
<i> and I can't stop it.</i>

00:00:17.082 --> 00:00:18.184
♪ (TENSE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:19.719
EMORY ANDERSON:
<i> Harry Haft, I'm a journalist.</i>

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:22.321
I covered your fight.
I'm interested in your story.

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:25.392
Everybody knows my story.
I'm the survivor of Auschwitz.

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:32.031
You fight until one man
can no longer get up.

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:33.366
(BELL DINGS)

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:37.537
GUARD: On the left!
Hands up! Hands up.

00:00:40.706 --> 00:00:45.011
My girl from back home,
she doesn't know that I'm alive.

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:48.048
<i> But if my name is
 in the papers...</i>

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:51.417
I wanna fight Marciano.

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:54.521
I will plaster your story
all over the East Coast.

00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:59.625
It says that you made a deal
to survive by fighting.

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:01.261
You're a traitor!

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:04.130
You think Leah's gone?

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:08.001
I hope she's alive,
and we'll keep looking for her.

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:11.170
I have to be famous
across America.

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:13.840
Enough with the glamour shots,
Rita Hayworth.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:14.808
Come on, get in here.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:19.044
CHARLIE GOLDMAN:
<i>Marciano's big hay hits harder.</i>

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:21.080
<i> You were taught wrong
 from the beginning.</i>

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:22.749
I'll give you two days training.

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:24.817
Why would you help me win?

00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:25.851
Win?

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:28.621
Boychick, I'm just giving you
a chance to lose

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:29.856
with a little dignity.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:35.228
I fought for her.

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:39.466
And that was the only reason
for-- for fighting.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.502
SPEAKER:<i> Six million
 of our people are dead.</i>

00:01:43.769 --> 00:01:46.806
Why did you survive
if not to live?

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:50.376
MIRIAM WOFSONIKER:<i> I've heard
 every imaginable awful thing.</i>

00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:52.011
You can talk to me.

00:01:52.111 --> 00:01:56.216
Why does this God
ask so much of us?

00:01:59.451 --> 00:02:02.088
I didn't want fear
in your heart.

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:03.288
(GRUNTS)

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:05.024
<i> Who deserves to have
 that kind of darkness</i>

00:02:05.124 --> 00:02:06.392
inside of their children?!

00:02:06.892 --> 00:02:09.496
His life... or yours.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.732
HARRY:<i> These are the choices
 we made every day,</i>

00:02:13.532 --> 00:02:18.404
choices made when you remember
that you once had a family.

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:21.240
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

00:02:22.141 --> 00:02:25.411
ANNOUNCER:<i> The survivor
 of Auschwitz!</i>

